{
  "uid": "ai-demo-agent-observability",
  "title": "Agent observability overview",
  "description": "The demo's one-screen story: what was decided, what the MCP doors did, what ran, and what is alerting. Reuses the exact queries of the P1AZ, pinggateway and server-events dashboards — no new instrumentation.",
  "tags": [
    "ai-demo",
    "observability",
    "overview"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "One-screen demo story. **Every query here is lifted from the existing dashboards** — decisions from the P1AZ log lines in Loki, door traffic from the Agent Gateway's admin connector (:8085) via Prometheus, app events from the BFF's structured logger. No new instrumentation.\n\n**Alert expectation:** a single DENY does not fire `McpDoorMostlyRejecting` — that rule needs >80% 4xx for 10 minutes across ≥10 requests, by design (RFC 9728 discovery makes 401 challenges normal traffic). The live demo moment is these panels reacting, not an alert ringing."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MCP door traffic · 15 min",
      "description": "Scale of traffic on the MCP doors. Decision counts come from the Loki panel below; this is the request volume behind them.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(ig_route_response_status_total{route=~\".*mcp.*\"}[15m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MCP door success ratio · 15 min",
      "description": "Share of MCP door responses that were not 4xx/5xx. The 0.8 floor is the McpDoorMostlyRejecting alert threshold — 4xx challenges are normal (RFC 9728 discovery), so this sits well above zero in a healthy stack.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "1 - (sum(increase(ig_route_response_status_total{family=\"client_error\",route=~\".*mcp.*\"}[15m])) + sum(increase(ig_route_response_status_total{family=\"server_error\",route=~\".*mcp.*\"}[15m]))) / sum(increase(ig_route_response_status_total{route=~\".*mcp.*\"}[15m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.8
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alerts firing",
      "description": "Rules from monitoring/alerts.yml currently firing. Zero is the healthy demo state.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Decisions by outcome (per 5 min)",
      "description": "PERMIT vs DENY, extracted from the DECISION: token on each P1AZ log line — the exact query of the P1AZ Decisions dashboard. A UC6 run puts a DENY on this chart within ~30s.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (decision) (count_over_time({service=\"ping-gateway\"} |= \"[P1AZ] DECISION:\" | regexp \"DECISION: (?P<decision>PERMIT|DENY)\" [5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "DENY"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "PERMIT"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "MCP door responses by family (per 5 min)",
      "description": "Response status families on the MCP doors. Talking point: 4xx near 1:1 with success is healthy — RFC 9728 discovery starts with a 401 challenge, so any 'client_error > 0' rule would fire forever.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (family) (rate(ig_route_response_status_total{route=~\".*mcp.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Tool calls by tool (cumulative)",
      "description": "Which MCP tools have actually been invoked through the gateway — same query as the pinggateway dashboard.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (mcp_method_param_tool) (ig_mcp_method_time_seconds_count{mcp_method=\"tools/call\", route=~\".*mcp.*\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{mcp_method_param_tool}}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Live P1AZ decisions",
      "description": "The raw decision lines behind the chart — this is the 'forensics' half of the demo in one panel.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=\"ping-gateway\"} |= \"[P1AZ] DECISION:\""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": false,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gateway metrics up",
      "description": "If this reads Down, every other panel here is blind rather than calm — the PingOneAgentGatewayMetricsDown alert watches exactly this.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "ai-demo-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up{job=\"pinggateway\"}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Down",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Up",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Activity · 1 hour",
      "description": "P1AZ decisions in the last hour.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 26
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"ping-gateway\"} |= \"[P1AZ] DECISION:\" [1h]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Activity · 24 hours",
      "description": "P1AZ decisions in the last 24 hours.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 26
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"ping-gateway\"} |= \"[P1AZ] DECISION:\" [24h]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Activity · 1 week",
      "description": "P1AZ decisions in the last week. Loki retention may be shorter than 7d — see the loki service config.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 26
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({service=\"ping-gateway\"} |= \"[P1AZ] DECISION:\" [7d]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "BFF app events",
      "description": "The BFF's structured event stream (appEventService) — the same stream the server-events dashboard covers, scoped here to the demo story.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "ai-demo-loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=\"ai-demo-bff\", logtype=\"app_event\"}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": false,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    }
  ]
}